# SwiftUI conventions

- Use `DesignSystem.Colors`, `DesignSystem.Typography`, `DesignSystem.Spacing` — not hardcoded values
- Use `PrimaryButton`, `TopicChip`, `LessonCard`, `MascotView`, etc. from `SparkComponents.swift`
- Use `.sparkCard()` and `.screenBackground()` view modifiers from `DesignSystem.swift`
- Minimum tap targets ~56pt for child-facing buttons
- Parent screens: calmer, white cards; child screens: colorful gradients and mascots
- Avoid `Form` — use `SparkInputCard` for profile fields
